{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The chain ordering and ring buffer proof tests match the intended flow. I found one lifecycle concern that the tests currently treat as acceptable: `gate` mints and stores its decision cursor when the middleware value is created, while the spec assigns that state to each wrapped handle at `wrap`. I’m checking the remaining contract details before assigning severity."}}
